        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-GNT625RDDCRGSBR, Garnet Reed Style Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom hardware for homes right here in the U.S.A. They offer some of the most beautiful styles in the world including this Garnet Reed Cabinet Pull. Very elegant, the slim reed-styled tubing comes packaged with everything you need to add your personal touch to your kitchen cabinets or furniture. Choose from 8 inch, 10 inch, or 12 inch pulls. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions AP-GNT625RDDCRGSBR Garnet Reeded Cabinet Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-810R-detailed-picture.jpg?v=1704354588\"><b>First Impressions GNT625RDDCRGSBR Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions GNT625RDDCRGSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625008RDDCRGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.43\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625010RDDCRGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.43\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625012RDDCRGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.43\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This cabinet pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
