                "description": "For over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom hardware for homes right here in the U.S.A. They offer some of the most beautiful styles in the world including this Garnet Reed Cabinet Pull. Very elegant, the slim reed-styled tubing comes packaged with everything you need to add your personal touch to your kitchen cabinets or furniture. Choose from 8 inch, 10 inch, or 12 inch pulls. \r\n",
